OL,3,GNEWSACharity wants bee, bird and
OL,4,Abutterfly population boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity wants to raise #70,000 for a
OL,7,Fproject aimed at boosting wildlife
OL,8,Fpopulations on farmland in the Thames
OL,9,FValley.
OL,11,FThe Berkshire, Buckinghamshire and
OL,12,FOxfordshire Wildlife Trust (BBOWT) said
OL,13,Fthe money would form part of its Nature
OL,14,FRecovery Fund and would be used to
OL,15,Ftackle falling numbers of birds, bees
OL,16,Fand butterflies.
OL,18,FThe trust said farmland bird
OL,19,Fpopulations had fallen by 63% since
OL,20,F1970, while half of the UK's 27
OL,21,Fbumblebee species were in decline.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
